		{"id":"24f86385bdc55ac3","type":"text","text":"# [[Maps.canvas|Maps]]","x":464,"y":-994,"width":115,"height":60},
		{"id":"9af4eceee9d39e17","type":"text","text":"## Sources\n- [Battle Report 3](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yvhL7ben1Wc)\n- [Battle Report 4](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ansr816Iujk)\n- [Battle Report 5]([https://youtu.be/2afDKfzXawg](https://youtu.be/2afDKfzXawg \"https://youtu.be/2afDKfzXawg\")","x":463,"y":-1195,"width":230,"height":179},
		{"id":"ec1b12cd0bbec985","type":"file","file":"Media/offi_dow4.png","x":260,"y":-1308,"width":113,"height":113},
		{
			"id":"514da6be40324e83",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"> [!Welcome]\n> This is a compilation of all the info from the 3 Battle Reports that were recorded on the August 2026 build.\n> \n> Click the tree links below to explore the tech trees of the different factions.\n> \n> Check the MOC (Maps of Content) folder for different ways to view info.\n> \n> Best viewed with the [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md/) app (free).\n> Get the latest version of this Obsidian vault with [git](https://gitlab.com/dow4-vault/DoW4-Obsidian).\n> Either pull, or download the .zip from there, extract it and then \"Open folder as vault\" into Obsidian.\n> \n> Tags can be used to search for specific stuff.\n> \n> Use Ctrl+O to open cards with fuzzy finding.\n> \n> This is all very much W.I.P..\n> Join the official [DoW4 Discord](http://discord.gg/dawnofwar4).\n> -- Artist",
			"styleAttributes":{
				"shape":null,
				"border":null
			},
